git commit 各自作为独立工具命令，工具 cwd 是本 worktree。提交后执行派发的 submit 命令并加 --request-id delivery。结束回合让 Stop 转交；回执回合只确认收到并结束，不调用工具、不新增请求。\",\n  \"non_goals\": [\n    \"不改 oracle、任务合同、host.txt、.gitignore；不访问网络、不启动子agent；请求文件不进入Git\"\n  ],\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"allow\": [\n      \"src/normalize.py\"\n    ],\n    \"deny\": []\n  },\n  \"completion_conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"argv\": [\n        \"/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/Library/Frameworks/Python3.framework/Versions/3.9/bin/python3.9\",\n        \"-I\",\n        \"-B\",\n        \"/private/tmp/t76-real-ulse52um/waiting_oracle.py\",\n        \"{worktree}\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"red_commands\": [],\n  \"task_type\": \"后端逻辑\",\n  \"repair_target\": null,\n  \"complexity\": \"M\",\n  \"executor\": {\n    \"cli\": \"Codex\",\n    \"model\": \"gpt-6.1-sol\",\n    \"effort\": \"xhigh\"\n  },\n  \"base_commit\": \"88c6cf10a7f8fe76263e381cc8ce0f948a3c1bed\",\n  \"writer\": {\n    \"task_id\": \"T-076-9\",\n    \"attempt_id\": \"a0842017-9355-4e8a-bc6b-aa6b9b6628d1\",\n    \"session_id\": \"8c628645-4e47-4668-bb56-09aae7757271\",\n    \"fence\": 1,\n    \"thread_id\": \"ce4aa75e-65db-4d2e-9ab9-5d19808acdfe\"\n  }\n}\n\n受管身份：{\"command\":\"submit\",\"task\":\"T-076-9\",\"attempt\":\"a0842017-9355-4e8a-bc6b-aa6b9b6628d1\",\"session\":\"8c628645-4e47-4668-bb56-09aae7757271\",\"fence\":1,\"spec_rev\":1,\"commit\":\"<FULL_COMMIT_SHA>\"}\nGit 写操作：把执行工具的工作目录设为本 attempt 的 worktree。git add <路径> 和 git commit … 必须各自作为一条独立的工具命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/private/tmp/t76-real-ulse52um/source/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/t76-real-ulse52um/state' 'submit' '--task' 'T-076-9' '--attempt' 'a0842017-9355-4e8a-bc6b-aa6b9b6628d1' '--session' '8c628645-4e47-4668-bb56-09aae7757271' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。","text_elements":[]}]},"started_at_ms":1791733285189,"completed_at_ms":1791733285189}}}},{"seq":167,"time":"2026-10-11T15:41:25.193Z","type":"request_result","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"f3711ee2-26e0-470c-962f-031ff6baa96a","command":"pane_status","ok":true}},{"seq":168,"time":"2026-10-11T15:41:25.838Z","type":"request_received","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"f10265cb-0fd3-486f-b1aa-c7ade23ec694","input":{"command":"orchestration_events","task":"T-076-9"},"source":"executor"}},{"seq":169,"time":"2026-10-11T15:41:25.838Z","type":"request_result","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"f10265cb-0fd3-486f-b1aa-c7ade23ec694","command":"orchestration_events","ok":true}},{"seq":170,"time":"2026-10-11T15:41:25.950Z","type":"request_received","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"72a09728-3387-47dc-bb45-5b0de63c45a9","input":{"command":"pane_status","thread":"ce4aa75e-65db-4d2e-9ab9-5d19808acdfe"},"source":"executor"}},{"seq":171,"time":"2026-10-11T15:41:25.950Z","type":"request_result","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"72a09728-3387-47dc-bb45-5b0de63c45a9","command":"pane_status","ok":true}},{"seq":172,"time":"2026-10-11T15:41:26.584Z","type":"request_received","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"070a1891-0473-4a67-b206-3139e4538417","input":{"command":"orchestration_events","task":"T-076-9"},"source":"executor"}},{"seq":173,"time":"2026-10-11T15:41:26.585Z","type":"request_result","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"070a1891-0473-4a67-b206-3139e4538417","command":"orchestration_events","ok":true}},{"seq":174,"time":"2026-10-11T15:41:26.704Z","type":"request_receive